        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Not that one, you have to do the other thing first!&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Remember those games you used to play on the couch with a friend, laughing and shouting side-by-side? Here comes a new challenge that will put your friendship (and your patience) to the ultimate test.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a puzzle platformer that can only be cleared when two people truly work together. One player flips a switch while the other dashes through the door. One acts as a stepping stone so the other can reach new heights. You'll literally have to work as one to beat these challenges!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strictly for Two!: Every level is meticulously designed for 2-player co-op. Going solo is not an option! (It's also lonely.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's Okay to Fail!: Failure is just part of the fun! Instead of blaming your friend, just laugh it off and find a new approach. You're in this together!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No Game Over!: The only &quot;Game Over&quot; is when one of you decides to &quot;give up&quot; first!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab your favorite co-op partner and dive into this hilarious adventure today!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Not that one, you have to do the other thing first!&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Remember those games you used to play on the couch with a friend, laughing and shouting side-by-side? Here comes a new challenge that will put your friendship (and your patience) to the ultimate test.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a puzzle platformer that can only be cleared when two people truly work together. One player flips a switch while the other dashes through the door. One acts as a stepping stone so the other can reach new heights. You'll literally have to work as one to beat these challenges!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strictly for Two!: Every level is meticulously designed for 2-player co-op. Going solo is not an option! (It's also lonely.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's Okay to Fail!: Failure is just part of the fun! Instead of blaming your friend, just laugh it off and find a new approach. You're in this together!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No Game Over!: The only &quot;Game Over&quot; is when one of you decides to &quot;give up&quot; first!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab your favorite co-op partner and dive into this hilarious adventure today!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
